WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Fang Qiu, have you ever thought about it?

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,960
Even without Luo Minwen

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:07,250
You will never be a mother again in this life.

4
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:10,020
If there is no cause and effect, which life will we turn to?

5
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:12,420
The cause and effect between you extends beyond this life

6
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:14,660
In the last life, Zhonglu was injured.

7
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:16,740
You are the legal wife of his fifth son for many years

8
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,620
He has a dancer named Luo Minwen

9
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:20,900
I was pregnant with Yun, and you agreed to take me into your house.

10
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,260
When Luo Minwen was giving birth

11
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,460
You bribed the midwife

12
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,090
Let that child bear the burden of stillbirth

13
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:27,890
Luo Minwen has been banned from now on

14
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:29,730
Holding a rag as a child

15
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,530
You still take pleasure in abusing him

16
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:34,130
In winter, he was forced to wear unlined clothes and get pierced

17
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:36,730
In the summer, he was forced to wear a cotton-padded jacket to show off.

18
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:38,690
He finally couldn't hold on anymore and committed suicide

19
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:40,890
I swear before I die that I will return all this to you.

20
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:43,760
So, this life is the other way around

21
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:46,600
In the last life, you harmed his child and forced him to commit suicide.

22
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,000
You have been punished in this life

23
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,120
Repeated the path he took

24
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:52,720
Who knew you were talking about a real fake girl?

25
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,160
You were sorry for me in my previous life

26
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:55,480
I'm sorry for you in this life

27
00:00:55,480 --> 00:00:57,080
We don’t owe each other anymore

28
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:59,120
All I ask is that you don't look for my son again
